('NewParents-1v2deqv','','partner','baby_2_4_months','pain','marriage_strain,maternal_exhaustion',r"""We’re exhausted and starting to feel pretty defeated. It is also putting pressure on our relationship because neither of us is getting enough rest, and we both feel like we’re failing.""",'Sleep strain on the couple.'),
